001000*------ PARMS FOR CALL TO "CMANREQ" - NON-STR REQ CREATE/         CMANREQ
001100*------ MODIFY/DELETE SUBPROG, AND "CMANINQ" - REQ INQUIRY        CMANREQ
001200*------ SUBPROG.  RETURN CODES:                                   CMANREQ
001300*------   "BC" - A BAD CORP CODE WAS PASSED - DID NOT EXIST.      CMANREQ
001400*------   "C1" - CANT MODIFY OR DELETE - CODED STOREROOM REQ      CMANREQ
001500*------   "C2" - CANT MODIFY OR DELETE - REQ ON PO                CMANREQ
001600*------   "C3" - CANT MODIFY OR DELETE - REQ IN PURCHASING        CMANREQ
001700*------   "NE" - REQ DOESNT EXIST (UPDATE, INQ, OR DELETE).       CMANREQ
001800*------   "OK" - SUCCESSFUL OPERATION.                            CMANREQ
001900*                                                                 CMANREQ
002000*------ THE CALLING PROG PASSES "CALL MODE" TO SUBPROG:           CMANREQ
002100*------ PROGRAM:                                                  CMANREQ
002200*------   "CR" - CREATE  (CREATE NEW REQUISITION)                 CMANREQ
002300*------   "UP" - UPDATE  (UPDATE AN EXISTING REQUISITION)         CMANREQ
002400*------   "IN" - INQUIRE (INQUIRE ON A REQ)                       CMANREQ
002500*------   "I2" - INQUIRE - WITHOUT DESCRIPTION                    CMANREQ
002600*------          (FOR FASTER EXECUTION IF DESC NOT NEEDED).       CMANREQ
